      "role": "user",
      "content": "But you just said restorative approaches are \"more comprehensive\" and align better with \"modern ethical goals.\" If a framework is more comprehensive and more aligned with our current moral evolution, isn't it essentially the superior model? It seems like we're just debating whether to use a better, more evolved system or stick to an inferior one.",
